{"script":"s_4_4_2_y","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]非常好！这下材料就足够了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]按现在的时间来算，我们完全可以在表演开始之前解决掉乐器的问题。太好了，金弦之厅的乐团联演会如期举行，欢愉与幸福将继续持续！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]额……只是举办一场宴会而已，你为什么要这么看重？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]你们是外来者，可能不太清楚我们金弦之厅的文化。举办宴会是我们黑森林住民的传统，而乐团联演正是宴会中的一环。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]我认为音乐是最能激发人类情感的方式之一。即便是在苦闷自闭的人，在听到我们乐队那扣人心弦的演奏后，也会感到心潮澎湃。音乐鼓励着他们继续面对生活。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]在灾变之宴发生后，森林的生活自此发生了天翻地覆的变化。在大家还没有从灾变之宴痛失亲友的悲伤中清醒过来时，森林枯萎魔物入侵的威胁就接踵而至……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]在一次又一次的生死考验之后，大家磕磕碰碰地走到了今天。为了生存而冷漠无可厚非，但我还是希望大家能感受到一点生活的温暖。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]我希望无论眼下的生活如何困苦，大家都能感受到希望！而宴会正像是能带来希望的天使，音乐则像是天使赐予的祝福——！呃，咳咳……要沉稳，要优雅……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]听起来好像很厉害的样子，虽然我听不太懂就是啦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]没关系，我现在就来给两位演奏一曲，你们就知道音乐能带来的力量了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]好啊好啊！快让我听听！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"松茸干和果汁已经准备好了！","tag":"tag_15"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show][cm]好，我就用长笛为你们演奏一曲——月光下的黑森林！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"fore","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"","layer":"fore","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[show]（在听完几番扣人心弦的演出后，你们拿去报酬，和奥斯帕克告别了。）[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"fore","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"（提交修复乐器的道具。）"}